Syntax: harvest reagent

This skill allows thieves to locate and harvest poisonous plants and fungi 
from their surroundings. Success depends on both skill level and the local 
environment - different regions yield different toxic components.

The harvested reagents can be used with poison weapons or sold to 
alchemists. Care must be taken when harvesting, as some reagents are 
dangerous to handle without proper knowledge.

To harvest reagents successfully:
- You must be holding a bladed weapon (slash/pierce) in your primary hand
- You need forceps or tongs in your off-hand for safe handling
- You must be in an area that contains toxic plants (natural environments)
- You need sufficient movement points to complete the task

The harvesting process takes time and concentration. Each successful harvest 
yields one reagent, and you can collect multiple reagents per harvesting 
session. Your weapon will gradually become duller with use.

